                  "value": {
                    "_type": "Constant",
                    "_fields": {
                      "value": "\n    Strategy schema evolution:\n\n    previous:\n      \"strategy\": {\n        \"fields\": [\"steps\", \"goal\"],\n        \"version\": \"legacy\"\n      }\n\n    v10.7:\n      \"strategy\": {\n        \"fields\": [\"steps\", \"goal\", \"context\"],\n        \"version\": \"v10.7\",\n        ...\n      }\n\n    Invariants:\n      - All previous fields are still present.\n      - New fields may be added (e.g., \"context\").\n      - Version must change (no accidental reuse of \"legacy\").\n    ",
